            "border_color": "#a0b842",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h4>Global Jeans Brand</h4><p>Denim • VMD Optimization • Multiple locations</p><p>Major global denim brand sought to optimize VMD performance in multi-brand retail environments. Focused on identifying which fixture layouts produce higher engagement and conversion.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>Identified optimal fixture placements</li><li>Improved engagement through layout adjustments</li><li>Standardized best practices across stores</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "#",
            "link_text": "View details →",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_kGDkaE": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-target",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#a0b842",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h4>Company-Wide Flow Deployment Impact</h4><p>Aggregate Analysis • Multiple customers</p><p>Flow examined performance across multiple customers who adopted Flow. Analysis shows significant outperformance vs. partial adopters and industry average.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>2024: customers using Flow saw YoY sales growth of 108.9%</li><li>2023: companies deploying Flow in all stores achieved 108.5% YoY growth</li><li>Outperformed partial adopters and broader industry average</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "#",
            "link_text": "View details →",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
